--[[
    Story Auto Farm (UI + Anti-AFK + Anti-Lag + Weather Monitor)
    - StartStoryBattle(world, boss, difficulty, team) + StoryFightDone(GrantId)
    - Difficulty: 1=Easy 2=Medium 3=Hard 4=Extreme 5=Nightmare 6=Insanity
    - Cooldown is per boss AND per difficulty; difficulties unlock in order,
      so "All difficulties" farms ASCENDING (Easy -> chosen) for every boss.
    - Boss box empty = bosses are read from StoryData (only the ones you unlocked).

    Changes in this version:
    1) AutoRejoin hook is now controlled by getgenv().BlockAutoRejoin (turned off on close)
       and wrapped with newcclosure + checkcaller.
    2) UIS connections (drag) are stored and disconnected on close / re-run.
    3) Log trimming removes the oldest label reliably (stored in a table).
    4) Gap now decays back toward the base value after a while without "slow down".
    5) Up to 2 fights at the same time (Fights button). All remote calls share one
       throttle, and each boss/difficulty is claimed by only one worker at a time.
    6) StoryFightDone is called on the remote named in the reply (GrantRemote), like the game does.
    7) "Towers" tab: Battle Tower auto-farm (Limitless / Malevolent / ...). It starts hidden runs
       through the game's own functions, so the game's AFK-rejoin watcher never fights with us.
]]

if not game:IsLoaded() then game.Loaded:Wait() end

-- 19) "Hard Tower" tab: climbs the Hard Tower floor by floor with TowerNextFloor("Hard"),
--     checks GetTowerRunSummary("Hard") after every floor and stops by itself on defeat /
--     run end / stop-floor. Settings are saved and it can auto-start after Rejoin / Server Hop.
--     The game's own auto-climb must be OFF, and a Hard run must already be active.
-- 20) UI callbacks are nil-safe (no error if the library fires a callback while the UI is built).
-- 18) UI is now Obsidian (deividcomsono/Obsidian), loaded over HTTP at start.
-- v4 changes:
-- 15) Weak-units tracker: first loss retries after 15s, second loss pauses that difficulty and
--     everything above it and shows it in the red bar; "Retry Weak" clears it.
-- 16) Cooldowns are read from the server (GetStoryTicketState): bosses with nothing ready are skipped,
--     and locked difficulties are never probed (uses Cleared + 1).
-- 17) Auto Story Tickets: for fully cleared worlds, bosses are left to cool down and collected with one
--     ticket once "Min ready" are ready. The script records how the game calls UseStoryTicket
--     (press the game's "Use Ticket" once per world) and replays exactly that.
-- v2 changes:
-- 9)  A lost fight now also pauses the higher difficulties of that boss (they are locked anyway).
-- 10) Settings (worlds, difficulty, bosses, team, fights, all-diffs, towers) are saved to
--     StoryAutoFarmSettings.json every 10s and on close, and loaded on start.
-- 11) Cooldowns are saved too, so after Rejoin / Server Hop no requests are wasted on bosses
--     that are still cooling down.
-- 12) "3D Render" button turns off 3D rendering (big CPU/GPU saver for AFK farming).
-- 13) Auto re-run after Rejoin uses getgenv().StoryFarmFile (default "StoryAutoFarm.lua"),
--     so a different file name works: getgenv().StoryFarmFile = "MyName.lua" before running.
