-- One floor per TowerNextFloor("Hard") call (the same call the game makes). After every floor
-- GetTowerRunSummary("Hard") is checked, so the loop stops by itself when the run ends, the
-- floor stops advancing (defeat) or the stop-floor is reached. Mods are not picked (HardMods={}).
